      "side": 1,
      "message": "Regarding this, it seems we haven\u0027t concluded that we really should avoid plain (non-volatile) _writes_ to the host\u0027s structures? i.e. simple `*host_mc \u003d tmp_mc` is fine? (Otherwise we should change such writes to WRITE_ONCE in other such places as well?)",
      "revId": "afa0cf57247a4862d8567e98be0964a8400951a9",
